Write a new bardic song. The Style line must begin with this exact routing marker:
HM1[{{ bard_name }}||{{ current_location }}]
Copy that marker literally and exactly, including both names and the two pipe characters.
It is metadata for the music generator, not part of the song. Never put it in the title or lyrics.
After the marker, add a 1-3 word mood. Respond ONLY in this exact format, nothing else:

Title: <song title>
Style: HM1[{{ bard_name }}||{{ current_location }}] <1-3 word mood>
Lyrics:
<lyrics with [Verse], [Chorus], [Bridge] structure tags>
